-Pagination is enabled via Ninja’s `paginate` decorator where applicable.
+List responses return `items` and `count`. Custom post/comment lists use `?page=` and `?page_size=` and keep the authenticated author scope. With `NINJA_AIO_APPEND_SLASH=False`, CRUD and auth paths have no trailing slash; the M2M paths explicitly keep their trailing slash.
 
