+
+## Migration validation
+
+```sh
+python -W error::DeprecationWarning blog/manage.py check
+python -W error::DeprecationWarning blog/manage.py test api
+```
+
+Seven HTTP tests cover signup and password hashing, public login, refresh,
+invalid credentials, partial updates, conflicts, both FK input spellings,
+owner-scoped custom lists, M2M links, comments, and password changes.
+
+Schemas use `Schemas`/`SchemaConfig`; async hooks and facade calls use the `a`
+prefix. JWT lookup uses `Author.aget`, custom views use `@action`, and handlers
+return dicts or `Status` instead of deprecated response tuples. The migration
+also fixes inherited authentication on the login endpoint and hashing on the
+password-change endpoint.
+
+Use `BLOG_SQLITE_PATH=/tmp/blog-v3.sqlite3` to try setup against a separate,
+fresh SQLite database. These instructions do not publish a release or deploy.
